WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 16=

5
02:13.700 --> 02:14.140
Your Highness.

6
02:15.300 --> 02:15.860
The ground is cold.

7
02:19.300 --> 02:20.110
Why are you here?

8
02:35.620 --> 02:36.900
Let me keep you company.

9
02:38.460 --> 02:39.020
Two people

10
02:40.140 --> 02:41.140
are warmer than one.

11
02:55.550 --> 02:57.580
We went through so much to get back.

12
03:00.830 --> 03:02.070
Chunhua can't die.

13
03:05.580 --> 03:06.390
Can you tell me

14
03:07.180 --> 03:08.070
what happened?

15
03:09.700 --> 03:11.300
We fled North Jing.

16
03:14.230 --> 03:15.830
Only Chunhua and I survived.

17
03:20.620 --> 03:21.620
The snow

18
03:22.070 --> 03:22.830
was so heavy.

19
03:26.230 --> 03:27.110
The road was endless.

20
03:30.020 --> 03:31.990
However far we walked, it never ended.

21
03:33.670 --> 03:34.110
Your Highness,

22
03:36.270 --> 03:37.390
you've left it all behind.

23
03:39.620 --> 03:40.900
Have I really?

24
03:58.180 --> 03:58.790
Your Highness,

25
04:00.510 --> 04:01.830
you're back in Sheng'an now.

26
04:05.860 --> 04:07.270
It hasn't snowed here yet.

27
04:08.420 --> 04:09.460
The snow in your heart

28
04:11.020 --> 04:11.860
should melt.

29
04:13.140 --> 04:14.270
But this moon

30
04:16.300 --> 04:17.620
is exactly like the one

31
04:18.710 --> 04:19.990
I saw in North Jing.

32
04:21.910 --> 04:23.380
On those snowy nights,

33
04:24.060 --> 04:26.060
we often saw a moon just like this.

34
04:28.260 --> 04:29.820
What Chunhua suffered

35
04:31.940 --> 04:33.500
was no different from what I did.

36
04:43.550 --> 04:44.030
Your Highness,

37
04:45.990 --> 04:47.500
you made it back safely.

38
04:49.060 --> 04:50.380
Chunhua will be fine, too.

39
04:52.620 --> 04:52.990
Right.

40
04:54.550 --> 04:56.150
She'll pull through.

41
04:59.260 --> 05:00.620
It's just a miscarriage.

42
05:03.150 --> 05:03.990
I lost

43
05:06.590 --> 05:07.670
so much blood back then,

44
05:09.790 --> 05:10.940
but I still survived.

45
05:12.030 --> 05:12.710
Chunhua

46
05:14.150 --> 05:15.300
will pull through, too.

47
05:18.710 --> 05:19.620
(But I don't want to!)

48
05:21.670 --> 05:23.670
(Even if I get what I want someday,)

49
05:25.230 --> 05:25.910
(in this life,)

50
05:26.620 --> 05:28.350
(I won't bind myself to anyone)

51
05:29.230 --> 05:29.740
(or marry.)

52
05:31.380 --> 05:32.740
(So that's why.)

53
06:01.860 --> 06:02.620
You should go back.

54
06:03.380 --> 06:04.030
I'll stay with you.

55
06:05.670 --> 06:06.860
We'll wait for Chunhua to wake up.

56
06:07.940 --> 06:09.790
There's no need for you to stay.

57
06:14.710 --> 06:15.550
If that's what you wish,

58
06:16.590 --> 06:17.590
I'll obey.

59
06:18.990 --> 06:19.910
But there's something

60
06:20.990 --> 06:21.910
I must say before I go.

61
06:26.110 --> 06:27.740
Today and every day after,

62
06:30.990 --> 06:32.470
I want to stay by your side.

63
06:36.300 --> 06:37.670
We'll always stand high here,

64
06:39.110 --> 06:40.790
gazing out at the city.

65
06:52.230 --> 06:52.670
Your Highness,

66
06:56.350 --> 06:57.150
I love you.

67
06:58.820 --> 06:59.420
Yan Shang,

68
07:00.940 --> 07:01.990
you scum.

69
07:03.590 --> 07:05.030
I'm actually starting to believe you.

70
07:05.860 --> 07:06.710
Believe me.

71
07:07.940 --> 07:08.860
And I believe you, too.

72
07:10.230 --> 07:10.860
Before,

73
07:14.380 --> 07:15.860
I never thought

74
07:16.910 --> 07:19.180
the word "love" meant much.

75
07:20.910 --> 07:21.910
I never believed

76
07:22.710 --> 07:23.260
anyone would

77
07:24.550 --> 07:26.380
give their life for those two words.

78
07:27.230 --> 07:28.420
It's strange.

79
07:28.462 --> 07:32.252
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

80
07:34.780 --> 07:40.670
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

81
07:42.180 --> 07:42.670
Your Highness,

82
07:44.710 --> 07:45.350
don't worry.

83
07:46.940 --> 07:47.620
Don't give up.

84
07:49.740 --> 07:50.910
So many people care about you.

85
07:51.790 --> 07:52.500
You're so wonderful.

86
07:53.620 --> 07:54.820
You deserve all this love.

87
07:55.990 --> 07:57.670
You're worth risking my life to protect.

88
07:59.590 --> 08:00.060
So,

89
08:01.230 --> 08:02.180
whenever it is,

90
08:02.430 --> 08:03.690
♪Soar with the wind♪

91
08:03.740 --> 08:04.590
don't worry

92
08:05.180 --> 08:05.790
or second-guess yourself.

93
08:05.970 --> 08:07.210
♪Burning bright as a song♪

94
08:07.260 --> 08:08.300
Just ask,

95
08:09.790 --> 08:10.860
and I'll tell you.

96
08:11.820 --> 08:12.300
All right.

97
08:13.670 --> 08:14.180
I'll ask you.

98
08:17.110 --> 08:17.910
Why did you

99
08:19.500 --> 08:20.860
take the blame for me?

100
08:21.940 --> 08:23.110
Because I love you.

101
08:25.590 --> 08:25.990
Your Highness.

102
08:27.350 --> 08:30.920
♪... if you're there♪

103
08:31.210 --> 08:34.650
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

104
08:34.850 --> 08:38.310
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

105
08:38.360 --> 08:41.010
♪If we can stay♪

106
08:41.060 --> 08:45.420
♪Let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

107
08:45.580 --> 08:47.790
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

108
08:47.790 --> 08:50.000
♪- May time be free of pain - Lights fade, seasons turn♪

109
08:50.050 --> 08:52.510
♪You're the only one I need♪

110
08:52.860 --> 08:59.850
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

111
09:00.000 --> 09:01.790
♪Be my one and only in this world♪

112
09:01.840 --> 09:03.190
♪Be my one and only in this life♪

113
09:03.720 --> 09:05.780
♪My last untouched innocence♪

114
09:19.260 --> 09:20.990
The Zheng Xing case is closed?

115
09:22.500 --> 09:22.900
Yes.

116
09:23.710 --> 09:24.760
The Capital Prefecture, Justice Ministry,

117
09:24.761 --> 09:25.990
Court of Judicial Review, Ministry of Revenue...

118
09:26.190 --> 09:26.950
all their case files

119
09:27.740 --> 09:28.380
are here.

120
09:30.070 --> 09:31.020
Zheng Xing

121
09:32.500 --> 09:33.990
nearly ruined my grand plan.

122
09:34.990 --> 09:36.900
What a fool. His arrogance got him killed.

123
09:38.740 --> 09:39.990
Sheng'an is a tough place to manage.

124
09:40.110 --> 09:40.900
I never imagined

125
09:41.380 --> 09:43.020
that a mere hunting ground

126
09:43.590 --> 09:45.660
would spark such a war of words.

127
09:46.190 --> 09:46.590
Zidu,

128
09:47.620 --> 09:48.540
I'll be counting on you

129
09:48.710 --> 09:50.540
to handle the hunting ground matter.

130
09:51.900 --> 09:52.660
You can count on me, sir.

131
09:53.470 --> 09:54.584
But lately,

132
09:54.626 --> 09:56.596
a bunch of officials have been at it nonstop,

133
09:57.230 --> 10:00.020
arguing over Zheng Xing wounding Prince of Jin.

134
10:02.110 --> 10:02.780
Officials?

135
10:04.350 --> 10:06.950
If they didn't argue all day,

136
10:08.070 --> 10:09.830
what would we pay them for?

137
10:12.620 --> 10:15.140
The real problem

138
10:15.500 --> 10:16.540
is that maid.

139
10:17.740 --> 10:18.540
Take her to the Yintaimen.

140
10:19.620 --> 10:20.380
Beat her to death.

141
10:21.020 --> 10:22.470
That should settle the matter.

142
10:25.310 --> 10:26.230
Rest assured, Your Highness.

143
10:27.190 --> 10:30.470
Miss Chunhua's pulse is steady. She's out of danger.

144
10:31.070 --> 10:33.260
She just needs some rest.

145
10:40.900 --> 10:42.110
What about the child she's carrying?

146
10:45.620 --> 10:46.470
Both mother and child

147
10:47.380 --> 10:48.190
are safe.

148
10:51.900 --> 10:53.660
This... this is strange.

149
10:54.140 --> 10:57.190
She was beyond saving.

150
10:58.140 --> 11:00.590
How did she suddenly recover?

151
11:03.430 --> 11:04.070
Imperial Physician Huang,

152
11:06.380 --> 11:07.780
you've served here for your whole life.

153
11:09.110 --> 11:10.470
You know the rules

154
11:11.140 --> 11:11.740
of the palace.

155
11:12.740 --> 11:13.430
I do.

156
11:14.310 --> 11:14.860
I understand.

157
11:18.110 --> 11:18.740
Imperial Physician Huang,

158
11:19.900 --> 11:20.860
a healer's heart should be kind.

159
11:21.470 --> 11:22.710
And the kindest thing

160
11:23.190 --> 11:24.020
is to keep your mouth shut.

161
11:27.260 --> 11:28.190
Thank you, Your Highness.

162
11:37.590 --> 11:37.990
Your Highness,

163
11:38.470 --> 11:39.660
an attendant from Yintaimen is here.

164
11:42.740 --> 11:45.830
Your Highness, you'd better settle this soon.

165
11:46.860 --> 11:48.540
The Investigation Office is swamped.

166
11:49.110 --> 11:51.470
They'll only wait two more days.

167
12:19.700 --> 12:24.180
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

168
12:24.180 --> 12:28.660
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

169
12:34.660 --> 12:36.700
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

170
12:45.070 --> 12:46.660
(Duke of Zhao's Residence) Please leave, Your Highness.

171
12:46.990 --> 12:48.070
Lord Yu is busy today.

172
12:48.310 --> 12:49.070
He won't see uninvited guests.

173
13:00.700 --> 13:06.780
(Duke of Zhao's Residence)

174
13:30.830 --> 13:31.380
Your Highness.

175
13:33.350 --> 13:34.830
Why so quiet now that you're here?

176
13:44.020 --> 13:45.190
What happened, Your Highness?

177
13:46.430 --> 13:47.230
You're scaring me.

178
13:48.900 --> 13:49.500
Chunhua...

179
13:54.140 --> 13:55.070
Do you want to live?

180
14:06.990 --> 14:07.620
So,

181
14:09.660 --> 14:11.230
even though I've done nothing wrong,

182
14:13.070 --> 14:14.190
I'm like a chicken,

183
14:15.500 --> 14:16.620
like a sheep,

184
14:17.990 --> 14:19.430
at their mercy to kill,

185
14:20.590 --> 14:21.830
just to give them an answer.

186
14:22.710 --> 14:23.310
Yes.

187
14:25.260 --> 14:26.540
To Yu Cheng'an,

188
14:28.860 --> 14:30.780
people who've lost homes and land don't matter.

189
14:33.230 --> 14:34.780
Court gossip doesn't matter.

190
14:36.900 --> 14:38.430
Zheng Xing's death doesn't matter.

191
14:40.070 --> 14:40.660
You and I

192
14:42.110 --> 14:42.780
don't matter either.

193
14:52.260 --> 14:52.830
Chunhua,

194
14:54.620 --> 14:55.780
it's because you're insignificant

195
14:57.380 --> 14:58.860
that there's still a chance.

196
15:00.620 --> 15:02.470
Yu Cheng'an doesn't care about you.

197
15:03.430 --> 15:05.740
Yintaimen couldn't even be bothered to send anyone.

198
15:07.020 --> 15:08.190
They've left me to handle it myself.

199
15:11.470 --> 15:12.470
I've thought of two ways

200
15:13.230 --> 15:14.500
to keep you out of Yintaimen.

201
15:15.950 --> 15:17.590
I doubt Yu Cheng'an will make a fuss.

202
15:19.590 --> 15:20.350
What are they?

203
15:23.190 --> 15:23.780
The first way:

204
15:24.900 --> 15:25.780
I'll find a way

205
15:26.590 --> 15:27.660
for Liu Wenji to take you away.

206
15:29.950 --> 15:30.500
A carriage,

207
15:30.990 --> 15:32.020
clothes, food, and money...

208
15:32.380 --> 15:33.190
I'll have it all ready.

209
15:33.740 --> 15:34.830
You must leave before curfew.

210
15:35.660 --> 15:36.830
But you can't return to Lingnan.

211
15:37.590 --> 15:38.500
You'd be better off in the Shu region.

212
15:47.540 --> 15:47.950
No.

213
15:51.110 --> 15:53.020
I can't drag him down with me.

214
15:58.380 --> 15:59.590
What's the second?

215
16:11.140 --> 16:12.020
Marry Prince of Jin.

216
16:13.540 --> 16:14.350
That will save your life.

217
16:18.740 --> 16:19.310
Why?

218
16:23.590 --> 16:24.860
Are you giving up on me?

219
16:31.710 --> 16:32.310
Chunhua,

220
16:34.540 --> 16:35.830
now Zheng Xing's death

221
16:37.310 --> 16:38.710
is blamed on Prince of Jin's injury,

222
16:40.190 --> 16:41.260
and Yu Cheng'an blames you

223
16:42.310 --> 16:43.620
for Prince of Jin's injury.

224
16:46.430 --> 16:48.110
The hunting ground sparked public outrage.

225
16:48.900 --> 16:49.860
A powerful eunuch died.

226
16:50.350 --> 16:51.230
A prince was wounded.

227
16:52.140 --> 16:52.660
And in the end,

228
16:53.110 --> 16:54.310
it all fell on you.

229
16:55.660 --> 16:56.540
The officials have made you

230
16:57.590 --> 16:58.830
the femme fatale behind it all.

231
17:03.140 --> 17:04.100
We're trapped in a dead end.

232
17:05.780 --> 17:06.390
For now,

233
17:07.950 --> 17:09.780
these are the only ways I can think of.

234
17:17.580 --> 17:18.950
I don't want either.

235
17:43.860 --> 17:49.140
♪A daughter ventures forth, in the name her father gave♪

236
17:49.950 --> 17:56.130
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

237
17:58.180 --> 18:03.580
♪The fate is sealed, a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

238
18:04.860 --> 18:07.630
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

239
18:07.630 --> 18:08.100
Your Highness,

240
18:10.710 --> 18:11.820
I'm a simple person.

241
18:14.340 --> 18:15.950
There's a lot I don't understand

242
18:16.870 --> 18:18.100
or see clearly.

243
18:21.780 --> 18:23.340
But now, I finally get it.

244
18:27.540 --> 18:31.580
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

245
18:31.710 --> 18:32.190
Your Highness...

246
18:32.190 --> 18:33.960
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

247
18:35.150 --> 18:36.740
We've suffered too much.

248
18:39.580 --> 18:41.580
Even if I die, I won't accept this.

249
18:41.622 --> 18:45.602
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

250
18:45.650 --> 18:47.800
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

251
18:48.060 --> 18:48.910
I finally get it.

252
18:48.952 --> 18:51.592
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

253
18:51.740 --> 18:52.630
No matter what,

254
18:52.672 --> 18:53.302
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

255
18:53.580 --> 18:54.470
however hard it gets,

256
18:56.300 --> 18:57.580
I'll survive.

257
18:59.820 --> 19:00.430
I know.

258
19:00.472 --> 19:02.292
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

259
19:02.340 --> 19:04.630
Living has always been the hardest thing.

260
19:05.630 --> 19:07.100
Always enduring pain,

261
19:07.710 --> 19:09.540
swallowing your tears and bearing it all.

262
19:09.780 --> 19:13.760
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

263
19:15.580 --> 19:17.230
I ask for nothing else.

264
19:17.272 --> 19:21.592
♪I'll guard my princess, and keep her tears at bay♪

265
19:22.870 --> 19:24.340
Whatever happens,

266
19:26.950 --> 19:28.470
I'll always be your Chunhua.

267
19:31.470 --> 19:32.990
Please don't abandon me.

268
19:32.990 --> 19:35.910
♪You did no wrong, so why this pain?♪

269
19:35.910 --> 19:36.580
Chunhua.

270
19:45.060 --> 19:46.500
I'm not abandoning you.

271
19:48.500 --> 19:50.100
You're all I have left.

272
19:51.990 --> 19:52.950
I'm just

273
19:54.710 --> 19:55.910
too weak.

274
19:55.952 --> 19:58.022
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

275
19:58.260 --> 19:59.740
I failed to protect you.

276
19:59.782 --> 20:02.492
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

277
20:02.540 --> 20:04.840
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

278
20:05.090 --> 20:08.440
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

279
20:08.490 --> 20:10.180
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

280
20:12.360 --> 20:16.460
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

281
20:16.620 --> 20:19.610
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

282
20:19.660 --> 20:25.890
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

283
20:26.420 --> 20:30.290
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

284
20:31.390 --> 20:32.430
Don't cry, Your Highness.

285
20:33.690 --> 20:37.690
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers, breach the city gates♪

286
20:44.780 --> 20:46.020
Take me to Prince of Jin's residence.

287
20:51.140 --> 20:55.500
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

288
20:57.040 --> 20:59.170
♪A scar for a scar♪

289
21:00.460 --> 21:02.820
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

290
21:05.290 --> 21:09.500
♪Mourn the blooms of youth♪

291
21:10.780 --> 21:13.320
♪Mourn my bridal hair♪

292
21:14.360 --> 21:16.820
♪Dust veils the way back home♪

293
21:21.670 --> 21:22.300
Your Highness,

294
21:23.580 --> 21:25.670
I'm afraid there's nothing I can do.

295
21:26.260 --> 21:27.910
I can't prescribe anything new.

296
21:30.870 --> 21:31.470
Then should I keep

297
21:32.260 --> 21:33.060
taking this medicine?

298
21:37.260 --> 21:38.910
Forgive my bluntness,

299
21:39.670 --> 21:41.870
but I'm afraid your impotence

300
21:42.470 --> 21:43.870
isn't caused by a physical injury,

301
21:44.470 --> 21:45.630
but by emotional distress.

302
21:46.020 --> 21:47.630
Medicine can hardly help.

303
21:48.950 --> 21:50.609
I... I'll take a few more doses.

304
21:50.651 --> 21:51.841
Please treat me again.

305
21:52.870 --> 21:55.020
I'm afraid my medical skills fall short.

306
21:55.950 --> 21:56.540
Perhaps

307
21:56.950 --> 21:58.230
you should visit the Imperial Medical Office

308
21:59.060 --> 22:00.670
for another opinion.

309
22:02.340 --> 22:03.300
Please forgive me!

310
22:03.670 --> 22:04.950
I'll take my leave.

311
22:05.430 --> 22:07.020
Who at the Imperial Medical Office can help?

312
22:07.260 --> 22:08.580
Give me a name!

313
22:16.910 --> 22:17.670
Greetings, Your Highness.

314
22:30.500 --> 22:32.060
Why take this useless medicine?

315
22:35.340 --> 22:36.470
Let's try again.

316
22:36.990 --> 22:37.870
Give it a few more days.

317
22:38.230 --> 22:39.990
I think you should stop trying.

318
22:40.580 --> 22:41.780
It's been three years.

319
22:42.500 --> 22:43.479
Even when you were perfectly healthy,

320
22:43.521 --> 22:45.041
you couldn't father a child.

321
22:45.780 --> 22:46.390
And now,

322
22:46.740 --> 22:48.300
you should focus on looking after yourself.

323
22:53.260 --> 22:55.300
I just hate that my father is so blind.

324
22:56.100 --> 22:58.950
With so many talented officials and young royals at court,

325
22:59.540 --> 23:00.740
he weighed all the options,

326
23:02.190 --> 23:03.540
only to choose you!

327
23:04.820 --> 23:06.060
I've wasted my whole life for nothing!

328
23:08.470 --> 23:10.990
Your father wanted you to marry the Crown Prince,

329
23:11.300 --> 23:12.950
but he wouldn't marry you.

330
23:16.820 --> 23:17.780
What did you say?

331
23:18.020 --> 23:18.870
Still dodging?

332
23:19.820 --> 23:20.470
Dodge this!

333
23:20.990 --> 23:21.670
Dodging, are you?

334
23:21.910 --> 23:23.100
Ow!

335
23:24.950 --> 23:25.990
It hurts like hell...

336
23:26.740 --> 23:27.990
Oh, my!

337
23:29.500 --> 23:30.950
Why did you hit my leg?

338
23:32.870 --> 23:34.260
(Prince of Jin's Residence) Should we tell His Highness?

339
23:34.540 --> 23:35.479
I'm going back to my family home.

340
23:35.521 --> 23:36.651
Why should I tell him?

341
24:16.460 --> 24:18.900
(Prince of Jin's Residence)

342
24:19.740 --> 24:20.990
So what if I can't perform?

343
24:24.300 --> 24:25.710
I don't care one bit.

344
24:35.910 --> 24:36.500
Wait, that's not right.

345
24:37.300 --> 24:38.300
This is great!

346
24:40.190 --> 24:41.870
Even the Crown Prince won't dare marry and have children.

347
24:42.950 --> 24:43.950
Now that I can't perform,

348
24:44.740 --> 24:45.780
I can't have children either.

349
24:47.060 --> 24:48.430
Lord Yu will stop keeping tabs on me.

350
24:49.950 --> 24:51.100
This is great!

351
24:51.710 --> 24:52.630
Just great!

352
25:28.230 --> 25:28.780
Your Highness,

353
25:29.870 --> 25:30.780
does it still hurt?

354
25:35.020 --> 25:36.540
Chunhua...

355
25:40.500 --> 25:41.820
You were badly injured,

356
25:42.670 --> 25:43.780
so I came to visit.

357
25:46.820 --> 25:48.060
Chunhua!

358
25:58.630 --> 25:59.300
All right.

359
26:00.430 --> 26:00.820
Don't cry.

360
26:02.390 --> 26:02.820
Don't cry.

361
26:18.910 --> 26:19.870
Stop already!

362
26:20.150 --> 26:20.929
Quick, get me back!

363
26:20.971 --> 26:22.081
I-I feel terrible.

364
26:22.150 --> 26:23.719
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace) My whole body aches...

365
26:23.761 --> 26:24.561
Mu Ti, don't go.

366
26:27.870 --> 26:28.740
I came today

367
26:29.100 --> 26:30.340
not to give you a hard time,

368
26:30.910 --> 26:32.020
but to congratulate you.

369
26:33.950 --> 26:35.820
Congratulate me? For what?

370
26:37.430 --> 26:40.209
Ow!

371
26:40.251 --> 26:41.211
Congratulations.

372
26:42.780 --> 26:43.990
Chunhua is pregnant.

373
26:46.820 --> 26:47.470
Really?

374
26:54.780 --> 26:55.950
I'm going to be a father!

375
26:58.910 --> 26:59.990
Am I dreaming?

376
27:02.710 --> 27:03.150
Ow.

377
27:05.100 --> 27:05.710
Wanyao,

378
27:06.500 --> 27:07.929
I'm barely hanging on.

379
27:07.971 --> 27:09.451
Don't tease me.

380
27:11.060 --> 27:12.190
It's true.

381
27:13.670 --> 27:14.580
I came today

382
27:15.100 --> 27:16.430
to ask you

383
27:17.230 --> 27:18.740
what you plan to do about Chunhua.

384
27:21.100 --> 27:22.430
Tell me what to do.

385
27:22.820 --> 27:23.710
Bring her into your household,

386
27:24.060 --> 27:24.910
make her a secondary consort,

387
27:25.670 --> 27:26.820
and record her in the royal registry.

388
27:34.260 --> 27:35.300
What...

389
27:36.430 --> 27:38.430
Wh-What now?

390
27:38.870 --> 27:39.470
Mu Ti,

391
27:40.780 --> 27:43.470
Chunhua is my most trusted maid.

392
27:45.260 --> 27:46.710
Take good care of her.

393
27:47.260 --> 27:48.870
Don't let anything happen to her.

394
27:50.430 --> 27:51.500
If I find out

395
27:52.100 --> 27:53.540
you've mistreated her...

396
27:54.710 --> 27:56.340
You have my word.

397
27:57.500 --> 28:00.190
I may be useless at everything

398
28:00.390 --> 28:01.630
and never have enough to eat,

399
28:01.870 --> 28:02.390
but

400
28:02.780 --> 28:04.630
I'll take good care

401
28:04.990 --> 28:06.540
of my woman and child.

402
28:14.670 --> 28:15.190
Good.

403
28:16.580 --> 28:18.100
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace) Remember what you said.

404
28:19.990 --> 28:21.670
If you take good care of her for life,

405
28:22.150 --> 28:24.630
you'll always be my good brother.

406
28:25.500 --> 28:25.910
Then...

407
28:26.430 --> 28:29.020
I'll choose an auspicious date to marry her.

408
28:29.100 --> 28:29.910
No need.

409
28:30.190 --> 28:30.950
It'll be tomorrow.

410
28:31.990 --> 28:34.390
Come to my place first thing tomorrow to fetch your bride.

411
28:43.340 --> 28:44.150
Ow!

412
28:44.950 --> 28:45.279
(Princess Danyang's Residence) (Careful.)

413
28:45.321 --> 28:46.171
(Give him the flower.)

414
28:46.230 --> 28:46.780
(Give him the flower.)

415
28:47.630 --> 28:48.540
(Sweep it clean. Look.)

416
28:48.950 --> 28:49.740
(Sweep it up properly.)

417
28:50.540 --> 28:51.100
(Watch out.)

418
28:51.580 --> 28:52.519
(Get that spot swept clean.)

419
28:52.561 --> 28:53.691
(Tie the flowers tight.)

420
28:53.733 --> 28:54.123
(Excuse me.)

421
28:56.150 --> 28:56.950
(A little lower.)

422
28:57.430 --> 28:58.950
- A wedding here? - (A little more.)

423
28:59.780 --> 29:01.390
Is Princess Danyang getting married?

424
29:03.340 --> 29:04.670
Could it be Yan Shang doesn't know?

425
29:07.260 --> 29:07.710
A little more.

426
29:08.670 --> 29:09.060
A little more.

427
29:10.260 --> 29:10.870
Sir.

428
29:16.500 --> 29:18.500
You work at the Princess's residence, don't you?

429
29:19.540 --> 29:20.540
Do you know Miss Chunhua?

430
29:21.230 --> 29:22.230
Please tell her

431
29:22.500 --> 29:23.500
Liu Wenji is here to see her.

432
29:25.580 --> 29:26.580
Who are you?

433
29:27.060 --> 29:28.230
Chunhua's getting married tomorrow.

434
29:28.470 --> 29:29.500
She can't just come out to see anyone.

435
29:31.500 --> 29:32.190
Tie it tight.

436
29:32.390 --> 29:32.950
Keep it straight.

437
30:07.580 --> 30:08.150
Your Highness,

438
30:08.950 --> 30:09.710
it's cold and damp tonight.

439
30:10.150 --> 30:10.950
Drinking will only harm you.

440
30:17.060 --> 30:18.150
Your wounds haven't healed.

441
30:20.430 --> 30:21.190
You should be resting.

442
30:22.100 --> 30:22.780
Why are you here?

443
30:25.580 --> 30:25.950
By the way,

444
30:26.470 --> 30:27.710
your friend Liu Wenji

445
30:28.670 --> 30:29.500
has been locked up.

446
30:30.500 --> 30:31.670
He caused a scene at the gate

447
30:31.820 --> 30:32.740
and tried to force his way in.

448
30:33.540 --> 30:35.340
I can't let him ruin Chunhua's wedding.

449
30:40.780 --> 30:41.870
Knowing Wenji,

450
30:42.670 --> 30:44.230
if he sees the wedding tomorrow,

451
30:44.540 --> 30:45.630
he'll only get himself into trouble.

452
30:47.340 --> 30:49.820
It's the best we can do for now.

453
30:51.100 --> 30:52.150
I just went to see him.

454
30:53.470 --> 30:54.150
I had nothing

455
30:55.020 --> 30:56.190
to say to comfort him.

456
30:57.020 --> 30:58.020
The way things stand,

457
30:59.540 --> 31:00.340
our fate is not our own.

458
31:02.500 --> 31:03.910
There's nothing comforting to say.

459
31:05.710 --> 31:06.990
How much longer

460
31:08.950 --> 31:09.870
must our fates

461
31:12.820 --> 31:14.340
remain in their hands?

462
31:21.190 --> 31:22.300
These hands of mine

463
31:23.820 --> 31:25.340
are useless in the end.

464
31:46.390 --> 31:47.150
Your hands

465
31:48.300 --> 31:49.630
saved Chunhua's life.

466
31:51.020 --> 31:51.910
You did the right thing.

467
31:53.430 --> 31:54.260
I'd have done

468
31:56.060 --> 31:57.150
the same.

469
31:59.950 --> 32:00.430
Yan Shang,

470
32:03.500 --> 32:04.470
all along,

471
32:06.100 --> 32:07.780
whenever I had to choose between evils,

472
32:10.190 --> 32:11.390
I always chose

473
32:12.950 --> 32:14.430
the path that let us survive.

474
32:15.990 --> 32:17.470
Even if we barely clung to life,

475
32:18.340 --> 32:19.910
even if we suffered disgrace,

476
32:21.500 --> 32:22.430
as long as we lived,

477
32:24.190 --> 32:25.580
we could always turn the tables.

478
32:27.780 --> 32:28.390
However,

479
32:30.500 --> 32:31.670
that was my path.

480
32:34.150 --> 32:34.870
And now,

481
32:36.230 --> 32:37.780
Chunhua has taken it, too.

482
32:45.100 --> 32:46.150
Chunhua is just like you.

483
32:47.390 --> 32:48.630
You're both remarkable women.

484
32:51.060 --> 32:52.100
Born into this place,

485
32:52.430 --> 32:53.340
surrounded by thorns,

486
32:54.190 --> 32:55.580
you two are braver than anyone.

487
32:57.470 --> 32:58.340
Even if the road to survival

488
32:58.950 --> 33:00.870
is more painful than death,

489
33:02.780 --> 33:04.150
