34:49.830 --> 34:50.950
Chunhua, is that you?

518
34:50.950 --> 34:51.790
Say something!

519
34:55.220 --> 34:55.790
Chunhua?

520
34:56.700 --> 34:58.660
Chunhua, why aren't you saying anything?

521
34:58.910 --> 34:59.620
Say something!

522
34:59.830 --> 35:00.870
