526
35:05.990 --> 35:08.470
Why are you marrying, Chunhua?

527
35:11.220 --> 35:11.990
Chunhua!

528
35:12.350 --> 35:13.220
Say something!

529
35:13.950 --> 35:14.580
Chunhua...

530
35:17.660 --> 35:18.580
Say something!

531
35:19.140 --> 35:20.390
