534
35:22.990 --> 35:23.580
Why?

535
35:24.180 --> 35:25.390
Wait for me, Chunhua!

536
35:26.020 --> 35:26.580
Chunhua?

537
35:27.430 --> 35:28.060
Why?

538
35:29.620 --> 35:30.180
Chunhua?

539
35:31.020 --> 35:31.750
Why?

540
35:32.390 --> 35:33.100
Chunhua?

541
35:33.142 --> 35:34.872
♪Fate falls just short of granting our plea♪

542
35:34.920 --> 35:37.520
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

543
35:37.570 --> 35:41.040
