544
35:41.470 --> 35:45.630
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

545
35:45.860 --> 35:49.430
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

546
35:49.480 --> 35:51.540
♪May sorrow end, though sleepless we lie apart♪

547
35:51.590 --> 35:53.980
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

548
35:54.030 --> 35:56.970
♪Though close at hand, we're worlds apart♪

549
36:05.140 --> 36:05.660
Chunhua.

550
36:06.910 --> 36:07.750
Please, I'm begging you.

551
36:10.020 --> 36:11.350
