584
37:47.830 --> 37:50.770
♪Though close at hand, we're worlds apart♪

585
37:51.580 --> 37:58.440
♪Ask not how we've braved power's tides, through fading grass and setting suns♪

586
37:59.860 --> 38:03.420
♪Distant memories rise once more♪

587
38:03.920 --> 38:07.660
♪Could we meet anew in another life?♪

588
38:10.490 --> 38:16.100
♪How sweet the spring, how hard to leave♪

589
38:17.430 --> 38:18.350
He cried and shouted,

590
38:18.660 --> 38:19.700
without a break all night.

591
38:55.310 --> 38:56.100
Please, Mr. Fang.

592
39:11.500 --> 39:11.950
Yan Shang?

593
39:12.990 --> 39:13.430
Yan Shang!

594
39:16.990 --> 39:17.390
Yan Shang!

595
39:18.180 --> 39:18.540
Yan Shang!

596
39:19.350 --> 39:19.700
Yan Shang.

597
39:20.990 --> 39:21.620
Help me.

598
39:22.350 --> 39:23.500
I have to see Chunhua.

599
39:39.060 --> 39:39.620
Wenji.

600
39:40.390 --> 39:40.750
Get up.

601
39:41.430 --> 39:41.790
Get up!

602
39:46.100 --> 39:46.700
Wenji.

603
39:48.060 --> 39:48.790
I'm here with you.

604
39:52.060 --> 39:52.910
Eat something first.

605
39:55.830 --> 39:56.350
Yan Shang...

606
39:58.350 --> 39:59.220
I can't eat.

607
40:15.620 --> 40:16.790
I found them at your door.

608
40:24.100 --> 40:24.870
Chunhua was here.

609
40:26.350 --> 40:27.580
I knew she'd come.

610
40:28.660 --> 40:29.060
Yan Shang,

611
40:29.540 --> 40:30.310
I have to see her!

612
40:32.350 --> 40:33.081
- I have to see her! - Wenji!

613
40:33.700 --> 40:33.999
Wenji!

614
40:34.041 --> 40:35.011
