636
42:15.020 --> 42:17.830
For a thousand years,

637
42:17.872 --> 42:18.492
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

638
42:18.540 --> 42:21.140
may you be blessed!

639
42:30.830 --> 42:32.060
On this auspicious day,

640
42:32.470 --> 42:36.700
please enter the palanquin!

641
42:42.420 --> 42:45.820
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

642
42:48.540 --> 42:50.990
Lift the palanquin!

643
42:51.032 --> 42:54.782
♪The moon wanes and waxes, lovers part and reunite♪

644
42:54.830 --> 42:58.550
♪One moment too late, love slips from sight♪

645
42:59.150 --> 43:01.990
♪I've tasted the ache of wanting in vain♪

646
43:02.720 --> 43:05.700
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds heavy with rain♪

647
43:05.700 --> 43:06.180
Chunhua!

648
43:06.500 --> 43:06.870
Wenji!

649
43:07.220 --> 43:07.830
Wen... Wenji!

650
43:07.872 --> 43:11.422
