43:13.020 --> 43:13.390
Wenji!

653
43:13.580 --> 43:13.990
Chunhua!

654
43:15.430 --> 43:15.830
Chunhua!

655
43:19.310 --> 43:19.990
Liu Wenji!

656
43:20.620 --> 43:21.790
